  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xf6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Final phase of Swedish support to HIV and Aids activities in Niassa. Support is to an INGO working with HIV-Prevention and mitigation, mainly through capacity building of local communities to enable them to respond to the pandemic. The org also works on building information and awareness on rights and accountability within the relationship between citizens and the GoM.</narrative>
  </description>
